          "text": "ዱ ፡ ክፍት ፡ የሆነ ፡ እንደ ፡ ሆነ ፡ ጠላት ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 23,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በዚያ ፡ ገብቶ ፡ የባለ ፡ ቤቱን ፡ ቸብቸቦ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 24,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ውን ፡ ቈርጦ ፡ ገንዘቡን ፡ ዘርፎ ፡ ሲሄድ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 25,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "የዘጠኙ ፡ መዘጋት ፡ እንዳያድነው ፡ ዘጠ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 26,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ኙን ፡ መጠበቁ ፡ አንዱን ፡ በማፍረሱ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 27,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "የሚመጣበትን፡ ፍዳ፡ አያስቀርለትም፡ እን",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 28,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ደዚሁም ፡ ላንዱ ፡ መስጠቱ ፡ ላንዱ ፡ በመ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 29,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ንሣቱ ፡ የመጣበትን ፡ ፍዳ ፡ አያስቀርለ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 30,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ትምና ፡ ማቴ ፡ ፭ ፥ ፲፱ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 31,
          "margin_tag": "፲፩",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪፲፩ ፤ እስመ ፡ ዘይቤ ፡ ኢትሑር ፡ ኀበ ፡ ብእሲተ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 32,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ብእሲ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 33,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ከጉልማሳ ፡ ምሽት ፡ አትሂድ ፡ ያለ ፡ መጽ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 34,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሐፍ ፡ ያለ ፡ ጌታ ፡ ያለ ፡ ሙሴ ፡ ያለ ፡ አ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 35,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ዳም ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "column_index": 3,
      "lines": [
        {
          "line_num": 1,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ይቤ ፡ ኢትቅትል ፡ ነፍሰ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 2,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ነፍስ ፡ አትግደል ፡ ብሏልና ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 3,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወእመሰ ፡ ኢተሐውር ፡ ኀበ ፡ ብእሲተ ፡ ብእሲ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 4,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ከጉልማሳ ፡ ምሽት ፡ (ተሐውር) ፡ አለመ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 5,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሂድን ፡ ብትሄድ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 6,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወባሕቱ ፡ ትቀትል ፡ ነፍሰ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 7,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ነገር ፡ ግን ፡ ነፍስ ፡ ብትገል ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 8,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ኮንከ ፡ ውፁአ ፡ እምሕግ ።⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 9,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ከሕግ ፡ የወጣህ ፡ ሆንህ ። (ሐተታ) ፡ ከጉ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 10,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ልማሳ ፡ ምሽት ፡ አለመሄዱ ፡ ነፍስ ፡ በመ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 11,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ግደሉ ፡ የመጣበትን ፡ ፍዳ ፡ አያስቀርለ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 12,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ትም ፡ እንደዚሁም ፡ ላንዱ ፡ መስጠቱ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 13,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ላንዱ ፡ በመንሣቱ ፡ የሚመጣበትን ፡ ፍዳ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 14,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አያስቀርለትምና ። አንድም ፡ ከጉልማሳ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 15,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ምሽት ፡ አትሂድ ፡ ያለ ፡ መጽሐፍ ፡ ያለ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 16,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ጌታ ፡ ያለ ፡ አዳም ፡ ነፍስ ፡ እንጅ ፡ እን",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 17,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ዳትገል ፡ ብሎ ፡ ነው ፡ ኢተሐውር ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 18,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ከጉልማሳ ፡ ምሽት ፡ አለመሄድን ፡ ባት",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 19,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሄድ ፡ (ብትሄድ ፡ ማለት ፡ ነው) ፡ ነፍስ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 20,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "እንጅ ፡ ትገላለህ ፡ እንዲህም ፡ ከሆነ ፡ ከ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 21,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሕግ ፡ የወጣህ ፡ ሆንህ ፡ (ሐተታ) ፡ ቢገል ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 22,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ነፍሰ ፡ ገዳይ ፡ ተብሎ ፡ ይፈረድበታል ፤",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 23,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ቢሞትም ፡ ወኮኑ ፡ ቀታልያነ ፡ ርእሶሙ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 24,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ከተባሉት ፡ ይቈጠራልና ፡ ዘፀአ ፡ ፳ ፥",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 25,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፲፫ ፥ ፲፬ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 26,
          "margin_tag": "፲፪",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪፲፪ ፤ ከመ ፡ ዝ ፡ ንግሩ ፡ ወከመ ፡ ዝ ፡ ግበሩ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 27,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "እንዲህ ፡ ብላችሁ ፡ ንገሩ ፡ እንዲህ ፡ አድ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 28,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ርጋችሁ ፡ ሥሩ ። አንድም ፡ እንዲህ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 29,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አድርጋችሁ ፡ ሥሩ ፡ ብላችሁ ፡ እንዲህ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 30,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ብላችሁ ፡ አስተምሩ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 31,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ከመ ፡ ዘበሕገ ፡ ግዕዛን ፡ ሀለውክሙ ፡ ትትኰነኑ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 32,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በሕገ ፡ ግዕዛን ፡ በወንጌል ፡ ይፈረድባ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 33,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ችሁ ፡ ዘንድ ፡ እንዳላችሁ ፡ መጠን ። አን",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 34,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ድም ፡ ዘበሕገ ፡ ግዕዛን ፡ ሀለውክሙ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "column_index": 4,
      "lines": [
        {
          "line_num": 1,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በሕገ ፡ ግዕዛን ፡ በወንጌል ፡ ያላችሁ ፡ እና",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 2,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ንት ፡ እንዲፈረድባችሁ ፡ አውቃችሁ ፡ ም ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 3,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፩ ፥ ፳፭ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 4,
          "margin_tag": "፲፫",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪፲፫ ፤ እስመ ፡ በደይንሰ ፡ አልቦ ፡ ምሕር ፡ ለዘኢገ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 5,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ብረ ፡ ምሕረተ ፤⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 6,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "የርኅራኄ ፡ ሥራ ፡ ላልሠራ ፡ ፍትሑ ፡ ር",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 7,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ቱዕ ፡ ሥላሴ ፡ በቍርጥ ፡ ፍርድ ፡ ቀን ፡ አይ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 8,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ራሩለትምና ፤",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 9,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወይትሜካሕ ፡ ባሕቱ ፡ በዕለተ ፡ ደይን ፡ ዘገብረ ፡ ምሕ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 10,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ረተ ።⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 11,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "የርኅራኄ ፡ ሥራ ፡ የሠራ ፡ ሰው ፡ በቍርጥ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 12,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ፍርድ ፡ ቀን ፡ ደስ ፡ ይለዋል ፡ እንጅ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 13,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ማቴ ፡ ፭ ፥ ፯ና ፡ ፲፰ ፥ ፴ ፥ ፴፩ና ፡ ፳፭ ፥ ፵፭ ፥ ፵፮ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 14,
          "margin_tag": "፲፬",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪፲፬ ፤ ምንተ ፡ ይበቍዕ ፡ አኀዊነ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 15,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ወንድሞቻችን ፡ ምን ፡ ይረባል ፡ ምን ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 16,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ይጠቅማል ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 17,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
